The HIVff force-field files distributed in this repository were developed
within the CHARMM and CHARMM General Force Field (CGenFF) framework for
the modeling of HIV-1 replication inhibitors.

These files may contain topology definitions, atom types, parameters,
or parameter assignments derived from the CHARMM and CGenFF force-field
ecosystem. Nothing in this license shall be construed as modifying,
superseding, or replacing any rights, restrictions, or obligations
associated with the original CHARMM or CGenFF force fields.

